{
"dependencies": {
"vulnerable-lib": "1.0.0"
}
}
## Mitigation: Third-Party Dependencies
Regularly audit third-party dependencies for security vulnerabilities. Use tools like npm audit or OWASP
Dependency-Check to detect risks.Prefer actively maintained libraries with frequent security updates.

## Example: Restrictive Manifest V3 Policy
{
"manifest_version": 3,
"name": "My Extension",
"content_security_policy": {
"extension_pages": "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; object-src 'none';"
}
}

